            <ArticleTitle>Simvastatin: building on success.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>29-32</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Over a decade after launch, simvastatin remains the most widely-prescribed statin in the UK. This has resulted from a growing body of long-term outcome data, a steadily expanded range of indications, an extended dose range and proven cost-efficacy.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
